{"pageid":3758,"title":"Midnight Winter Vinyl","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Midnight Winter Vinyl</span>","revid":19544,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Midnight Winter Vinyl</b> is a <b>vinyl disc</b> that comes with the <a href=\"/wiki/Frozen_Vinyl_Player\" title=\"Frozen Vinyl Player\">Frozen Vinyl Player</a> after it is unboxed from the <a href=\"/wiki/Gift_of_Frozen_Beats\" title=\"Gift of Frozen Beats\">Gift of Frozen Beats</a>. The vinyl when played creates <b>snowflakes</b> which fall from the sky. When stopped, the music which is heard whenever on the property stops, as well as the snowflake effect. This is a <b>limited time</b> item only obtainable during the <a href=\"/wiki/2024_Christmas_Event\" title=\"2024 Christmas Event\">2024 Christmas Event</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902051011\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3758-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902051011 and revision id 19544. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Vinyls"],"links":[{"title":"2024 Christmas Event","exists":true},{"title":"Frozen Vinyl Player","exists":true},{"title":"Gift of Frozen Beats","exists":true}],"images":[]}
